[agent] The Query Service exposes a point-in-time join via `get_batch_data(spine=...)` — that runs the as-of join on the platform. Let me create a feature view and run the PIT batch with a spine at time T.
[agent:bash] cd "$(pwd)" && python3 -c "
[agent:bash] import warnings; warnings.filterwarnings('ignore')
[agent:bash] import pandas as pd, hopsworks
[agent:bash] project = hopsworks.login()
[agent:bash] fs = project.get_feature_store()
[agent:bash] hist = fs.get_feature_group('account_feature_history', version=1)
[agent:bash] 
[agent:bash] # Feature view selecting the 3 raw features; account_id + event_time drive the PIT join
[agent:bash] query = hist.select(['f1','f2','f3'])
